$ docker run --rm myapp:latest
docker: Error response from daemon: failed to create task for container: failed to create shim task: OCI runtime create failed: runc create failed: unable to start container process: exec: "/entrypoint.sh": permission denied: unknown.
ERRO[0000] error waiting for container:

$ docker inspect myapp:latest --format='{{.Config.Entrypoint}}'
[/entrypoint.sh]

$ docker run --rm --entrypoint sh myapp:latest -c "ls -la /entrypoint.sh"
-rw-r--r--    1 root     root            52 Jan 15 10:30 /entrypoint.sh

$ docker run --rm --entrypoint sh myapp:latest -c "head -1 /entrypoint.sh"
#!/bin/sh

NOTE: The entrypoint script exists but lacks execute permission (644 instead of 755).
The Dockerfile copies the file but does not run chmod +x before setting ENTRYPOINT.
